    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="a90f8a5e-bd9a-5035-8143-25e230884cdd" activityNameId="0154da76-0e18-5926-b2d9-8493acec7e67" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Hydrogen production, gaseous, 20 bar, from AEC electrolysis, from grid electricity</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Hydrogen production, gaseous, 20 bar, from AEC electrolysis, from grid electricity
1 kg H2 produced using a AEC electrolyzer. Source: Niklas Gerloff, Comparative Life-Cycle-Assessment analysis of three major water electrolysis technologies while applying various energy scenarios for a greener hydrogen production, Journal of Energy Storage, Volume 43, 2021, https://doi.org/10.1/j.est0.20.1. Stack lifetime of 55'000 hours over 7 years. Further refined (with respect to stack and system lifetime and water use, notably) from data from manufacturer's specifications and IndWEDe project report (https://www.now-gmbh.de/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/181127_bro_a4_indwede-studie_kurzfassung_de_v03.pdf). For further secifications (e.g., efficiency, lifetime, etc.), refer to Sacchi, R. and Bauer, C. LCA of Power-to-X processes and applications in the residential sector. Paul Scherrer Institut, 2023. Stack lifetime [hours] 55'000  IndWEDe Stack lifetime [years] 7 IndWEDe, based on the lower estimate of 8,000 hours per year, from manufacturers' data. Balance of Plant lifetime [years]: Same as system. System lifetime [years]: 27.5 IndWEDe Stack replacement over system's lifetime, excluding initial unit [unit]: 3 Calculated. Water demand [kg water/kg H2] 8.9, corrected to 14 to represent â€œreal worldâ€� operation.: (Simoes et al. 2021) Electricity demand [kWh/kg H2]: 51.8 IndWEDe. Electrical Efficiency [%, based on H2 LHV]: 64.5%:  From row above.Productivity [kg H2/hour]: 19.36: 18.52: 23.6: From row above. KOH [kg/kg H2]: 0.0 (Gerloff 2021a) Operating temperature [Â°C]: 60-80: Manufacturers' data. Operating pressure [bar]: ~20: IndWEDe Produced amount over system's lifetime years [kg H2]: 4,259,200: Calculated based on the system's lifetime (fourth row), and 8,000 hours stack operation per year (from manufacturers' data) and hourly productivity.

 UUID: e01d3162-41f7-3b3f-8da9-b035dac7f6f3
