BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e01d3162-41f7-3b3f-8da9-b035dac7f6f3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
